Subject: [PATCH 16/39] Version: Ibasho 0.1.0

Ibasho numbers its own releases (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH from VIEWER_VERSION.txt);
the build number is set by Ibasho's configure script to the number of
commits in the Ibasho series, so every change to the series gets a new
four-part version. The Linden Lab base is named in About.
